      "id": "claim_298abd0b6733414db4eac3d7e0f89149",
      "statement": "Process.classify validates an integer threshold in 1-10 and drives classify_async over extractor-group layers, each layer running its extractors concurrently through executor threads; CONSENSUS requires identical names, HIGHER_ORDER returns the max-confidence response, CONSENSUS_WITH_THRESHOLD requires both, failing layers are logged and skipped, and exhausting every layer raises ValueError.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://extract_thinker/process.py#L74-L125",
