      "statement": "When given a ClassificationTree, classify_async diverts to _classify_tree_async, which walks one tree level at a time using only the first extractor of the first layer, enforces confidence >= threshold, descends to children matched by Classification.uuid, and raises ValueError on null classification, sub-threshold confidence, or unmatched nodes.",
